msgid "introScreenView/blockDescription/howItWork"
msgstr ""
"A new door with gifts will be available for opening each day from "
"%(startDate)s through %(endDate)s. You can open Calendar doors for the "
"current and previous day. After %(endDate)s, doors can only be opened using "
"Holiday Ops resources."

msgid "introScreenView/blockDescription/magicLootbox"
msgstr ""
"Complete the Calendar Progression to receive additional gifts, including a "
"Large Christmas Box. It is only available for completion through "
"{FFE4C0_Open}%(date)s{FFE4C0_Close}."

msgid "introScreenView/blockDescription/whatCanYouGet"
msgstr ""
"Open all 31 doors to receive unique 2D styles, decals, days of WoT Premium "
"Account, Crew books, Personal Reserves, and other rewards."

